<title>USA: Commercial Bank of New York  Q4 shr up.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank of New York  Q4 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.43		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net		 2,286		    1,828</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,299		    5,299</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.37		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net		 7,249		    5,190</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,299		    5,299</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: 1995 net income included an after tax provision of $1.09 million for the expense associated with the early termination of the lease on the bank's Waldorf Astoria office. Excluding that charge, net income for 1995 was $6,280,000 or $1.19 per share and the year-to-year increase would have been 15.4 percent.</p>
